WEBVTT

00:03:59.663 --> 00:04:01.933
to the Beatles, Madonna and Ed Sheeran.

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:05.567
In 2009, Facebook rejected
a guy named Brian

00:04:05.591 --> 00:04:08.792
who went on to cofound
a company called WhatsApp,

00:04:08.816 --> 00:04:12.965
which Facebook bought
five years later for 19 billion dollars.

00:04:13.727 --> 00:04:16.784
And many employers passed on Dave Chang.

00:04:16.808 --> 00:04:19.809
DC: I think I interviewed
at every financial institution

00:04:19.833 --> 00:04:20.988
in New York city.

00:04:21.012 --> 00:04:22.811
And I mean, every single one.

00:04:22.835 --> 00:04:24.837
AG: He got just one second-round interview

00:04:24.861 --> 00:04:26.630
and zero job offers.

00:04:26.654 --> 00:04:28.504
So he found a job in a restaurant.

00:04:28.528 --> 00:04:31.568
DC: It was, weirdly,
the only job that I could get.